---
layout: layouts/admin.njk
permalink: "admin.html"
title: "Admin — Burgers N Beyond"
robots: "noindex, nofollow"
manifest: false
arabicFont: false
---
  <div id="loginView" class="admin-login">
    <h1>Admin Login</h1>
    <p>Log in to edit the menu, photos, site text, and daily specials.</p>
    <form id="loginForm">
      <div class="admin-field">
        <label for="loginEmail">Email</label>
        <input type="email" id="loginEmail" required autocomplete="username">
      </div>
      <div class="admin-field">
        <label for="loginPassword">Password</label>
        <input type="password" id="loginPassword" required autocomplete="current-password">
      </div>
      <div class="admin-error" id="loginError"></div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Log In</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div id="adminView" class="admin-page" hidden>
    <div class="admin-header">
      <h1>Admin Panel</h1>
      <button id="logoutBtn" class="admin-btn admin-btn-ghost" type="button">Log Out</button>
    </div>

    <div id="seedBanner" class="admin-seed-banner" hidden>
      <p><strong>No menu data found yet.</strong> Import the starter menu (the real items and prices already on the site) to get going — everything can be edited afterwards.</p>
      <button id="seedBtn" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">Import Starter Data</button>
    </div>

    <div class="admin-tabs">
      <button class="admin-tab active" data-tab="home" type="button">Home</button>
      <button class="admin-tab" data-tab="menu" type="button">Menu</button>
      <button class="admin-tab" data-tab="about" type="button">About</button>
      <button class="admin-tab" data-tab="contact" type="button">Contact</button>
    </div>

    <section class="admin-panel-section" id="tab-home">
      <h2>Home Page</h2>
      <p class="admin-hint">Every heading, paragraph, and review on the home page. Save each section separately.</p>
      <div id="homeContentEditor">Loading…</div>

      <h3 class="admin-subheading">Fan Favourites</h3>
      <p class="admin-hint">The cards under "What We're Known For". Add, edit, or delete as many as you like.</p>
      <div id="fanFavEditor">Loading…</div>

      <h3 class="admin-subheading">Branding</h3>
      <p class="admin-hint">The logo and Halaal badge shown in the header and footer on every page. Leave as the default or upload your own — doesn't affect the Halaal card photo on the About page, which is edited separately under the About tab.</p>
      <div id="brandingEditor">Loading…</div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-panel-section" id="tab-menu" hidden>
      <h2>Menu Page</h2>
      <p class="admin-hint">The heading text at the top of the Menu page.</p>
      <div id="menuContentEditor">Loading…</div>

      <h3 class="admin-subheading">Daily Specials</h3>
      <p class="admin-hint">Sets what shows in the "Today's Special" banner. Add as many specials as you like per day, or remove them — Sunday has no section since the shop is closed. Set a Price to let customers add the special straight to their order (via WhatsApp) — leave it blank to show the special as display-only.</p>
      <div id="specialsEditor">Loading…</div>

      <h3 class="admin-subheading">Menu Items</h3>
      <p class="admin-hint">Edit a name, price, or description and click Save on that item. Upload a photo by clicking "Change photo" under its thumbnail.</p>
      <div id="menuEditor">Loading…</div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-panel-section" id="tab-about" hidden>
      <h2>About Page</h2>
      <p class="admin-hint">The hero and story text at the top of the About page.</p>
      <div id="aboutContentEditor">Loading…</div>

      <h3 class="admin-subheading">Value Cards</h3>
      <p class="admin-hint">The cards on the About page, including the 100% Halaal card (edit its photo via "Change photo"). Add, edit, or delete as many as you like.</p>
      <div id="valueCardsEditor">Loading…</div>

      <h3 class="admin-subheading">Bottom Call-To-Action</h3>
      <p class="admin-hint">The "Come Taste The Difference" section at the very bottom of the About page.</p>
      <div id="aboutCtaContentEditor">Loading…</div>
    </section>

    <section class="admin-panel-section" id="tab-contact" hidden>
      <h2>Contact Page</h2>
      <p class="admin-hint">The heading text at the top of the Contact page.</p>
      <div id="contactContentEditor">Loading…</div>

      <h3 class="admin-subheading">Business Info</h3>
      <p class="admin-hint">Phone numbers, address, hours, email, and delivery/social links — edited once here, shown everywhere they appear across the site (nav, footer, info strip, contact page, map, checkout).</p>
      <div id="businessEditor">Loading…</div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div id="toast" class="admin-toast"></div>
